When I attempted to run the script, the WorkOS API returned a `403 Forbidden` error with the message: `"Default test organizations cannot be updated."`. This indicates that the `WORKOS_ORGANIZATION_ID` provided in the environment belongs to a default test organization which has restrictions on updates in the WorkOS environment.

